      "value": "No, that’s just nonsense for the crybabies who go, \"Oh, I don't like AI-generated art.\" In the vast majority of cases, AI can deliver work that’s on par with—or even surpasses—the quality of human-made art. It doesn't matter if it was created by a human or a machine; all that counts is the quality of the content. As long as what’s shown in an image or avatar doesn't violate VRChat’s current guidelines, there’s no reason for this type of content to be filtered out or removed from the game.",
